window.products.push({"id":712005,"name":"Wireless Perfect Bake Pro Smart Kitchen Scale and Recipe App","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rHmCXOinL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Welcome to easy, hassle-free baking that guarantees delicious success every time! Perfect Bake PRO pairs a smart scale with a companion recipe app on your phone or tablet. It measures as you pour and guides you step-by-step to make mouth-watering desserts, breads, appetizers, and more. From the Manufacturer Why choose PRO? Our top-of-the-line model, Perfect Bake PRO, features a wireless (Bluetooth 4.0) scale in beautiful stainless steel finish with backlit LCD display, making it a sleek addition to any kitchen counter. The scale is the most accurate on the consumer market and measures to the nearest 0.1 g. Bake by weight like the pros Master pastry chefs weigh their ingredients for the most accurate measurement—the key to consistent results. With Perfect Bake PRO, just pour directly into the bowls for an experience that’s three times faster than conventional baking. And no measuring cups means a much faster cleanup. Choose a recipe Choose from hundreds of pastry chef-tested recipes (or create your own). Just pour Forget measuring—just add ingredients. Perfect Bake tells you when to stop. Enjoy Baking Success. Deliciously perfect! Every. Single. Time. The possibilities are endless. With a growing collection of over 400 recipes, you’ll enjoy baking classic treats, experimenting with new recipes, and making delicious creations that will amaze your friends (and yourself). About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Delicious hassle-free fun How did you come up with the idea for this product? Mike grew up baking with his mother. After the success of Perfect Drink, he knew the measure-by-weight, guided recipe experience would make it easy for anyone to bake and enjoy baking success. What makes your product special? Perfect Bake PRO is not only useful, but really fun. It translates the “baking is a science” idea into an accessible, hassle-free way to bake. And the results are delicious every time. What has been the best part of your startup experience? We get a lot of great feedback. Some thank us for introducing their children to the love of baking. Others won’t bake any other way. It’s gratifying that people enjoy our product and find it useful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rHmCXOinL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Company","source_asin":"B019C4PTSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019C4PTSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019C4PTSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
