window.products.push({"id":712147,"name":"Demdaco Redhead Cardinal Bird Watercolor Glossy Stoneware Travel Mug, 16 Ounce, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qbVuBK5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Redhead Cardinal Travel Mug is perfect for nature lovers or to add a beautiful touch to a farmhouse. Mug can be paired with coordinating Dean Crouser snack plate. Coffee cup is made of stoneware, stainless steel, and plastic. Stainless steel interior keeps drinks warm for 2 hours. Let your family kick-start their day with a sip of tea or coffee in this charming travel mug. Mug measures approximately 7 x 5 inches and holds approximately 16 ounces of your favorite hold or cold beverage. Bring the outdoors inside. Perfect for an inspirational display or functional use on the go. Portrays nature's wildlife in life-like, energetic form through his vibrant and intricate watercolor paintings. Perfect for housewarming, wedding, or bridal shower gifting. By Dean Crouser Collection. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qbVuBK5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B01K48B23Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K48B23Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K48B23Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":712148,"name":"Plain Curved Bench Leg Concrete Mold 9015","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317vi3XPHlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our plain bench leg mold 9015 has a very simple but elegant look to use with any of our bench top molds. This bench leg mold has a narrower top then bottom giving it a more decorative look. Our bench leg mold with produce a leg that will measure approximately 15 1/2 inches tall, 12 inches wide at the base and 9 1/4inchs wide at the top and the thickness will be approximately 3 3/4 inch thick at the base and 3 inch thick at the top. If you prefer to have a thicker leg the mold can be poured twice and then mortared together to give both sides detail and added support.  All molds come with basic instructions for creating your pieces. Molds are ideal for business or hobby use. Our molds are made of several different blends of polyethylene plastic which allows you to use the molds over and over. Our plastic is somewhat flexible so it allows for your finished pieces to be removed from the molds easily. Our molds are a great way for you save money on that do it yourself project, create the finished look you want for pennies compared to what you would pay for these at a retail store. Make your own patio pavers to decorative stepping stones as well as garden benches and downspouts we've got you covered. You can use plaster, concrete, cement, mortar, resin and soap in all of our molds.  We ship UPS and USPS - so please include a physical address to ship to if you have a po box as some packages could be shipped out UPS due to the size, weight and location. Please note that international orders that shipping fees do not cover any additional charges that your country may declare as an import tax or fee once it enters your country. Every country has different regulations and not all have additional fees but we want all international buyers to be aware prior to making their purchases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317vi3XPHlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mold Creations","source_asin":"B00F2O2FJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F2O2FJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F2O2FJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
