window.products.push({"id":712154,"name":"TAB T9 Pro Cordless Wet Dry Vacuum Cleaner, Smart Vacuum Mop for Sealed Hard Floors Deep Cleaning, Upgraded Dual Roller Brushes Head, Vacuum & Mop & W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gNjoDIRQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must-Have for Deep Cleaning - The TAB T9 Pro wet dry vacuum features dual rollers that rapidly rotate to scrub your floor, removing loose dirt, distributing fresh water, and collecting everything in the dirty water tank. Even when you think your floors are clean, try the TAB T9 pro - the dirty tank tells all. Dual Brushes Make Cleaning More Efficient- Single roller brush wet dry vacuums require several passes to clean viscous fluids like milk, ketchup, etc., whereas dual roller brushes can drastically reduce cleaning time. The two rolling brushes each have their own drive, which allows you to move effortlessly back and forth throughout the floor. Smart Sensor Technology - The TAB T9 Pro smart vacuum mop is equipped with advanced sensor technology that detects wet and dry messes and adjusts suction power and water flow accordingly, ensuring complete cleaning every time. Quick Drying Mode - When you want to maintain the TAB T9 Pro's powerful cleaning performance, simply activate the quick dry mode. This boosts suction power, increases roller brush rotation speed, and ramps up water flow for more efficient cleaning with less water residue and streaks. Self-Cleaning System for Ultimate Convenience - With the TAB T9 Pro's self-cleaning brushes, you'll never have to touch dirty brushes on a clean floor again. As you clean, the brushes clean themselves, and after use, the self-cleaning function flushes the inner tubing and brush roller automatically. (Please note that to prevent odor, you should clean the dirty water tank after use and let the roller brush dry on the charging dock.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gNjoDIRQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAB","source_asin":"B0BXH4FF4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXH4FF4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXH4FF4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":712155,"name":"PACHAMAMA ESSENTIALS Bloodstone Crystals Raw Rough Natural Premium Grade Stones - Chakra Healing- Home Decor (Bloodstone)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3109AWnVfuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bloodstone Chakra Healing and Balancing Energy: Bloodstone is an intense healing stone used to cleanse and realign the lower chakras with the heart, and is conducive to balancing the total body in order to overcome any distress or anxiety associated with re-alignment of these energies. Bloodstone is a powerful healing stone used for thousands of years for its healing properties. Great at grounding negative energy and cleansing the body, Bloodstone brings love into any situation and helps ground the negative energies surrounding that issue. Bloodstone has been used to increase energy and strength. Hold Tumbled Bloodstone when you're in need of an extra boost, or feel the need to detoxify. You can carry Tumbled Bloodstone in your pocket to keep you feeling balanced, and to help you overcome fearfulness and worry. Bloodstone is thought to enhance intuition and creativity, and can be used to combat fatigue, irritability and confusion. Bloodstone has also known to be a great support for women during their menstrual cycle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3109AWnVfuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACHAMAMA ESSENTIALS","source_asin":"B09KMBB9HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KMBB9HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KMBB9HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":712156,"name":"Melwod 15.8\" x 118\" Kitchen Stainless Steel Contact Paper Self Adhesive Peel and Stick Wallpaper Aluminum Foil Textured Paper Stickers for Backsplash ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GE1pW8k0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metallic Stainless Steel Peel and Stick Contact Paper An easy, fresh alternative to decorating with a little commitment. Silver color along with geometric pattern brings you a real Aluminum Foil touch. Simple yet not settle. Both renters and homeowners’ top choice! Product Specifications: Color & Design: Metallic Stainless Steel Contact Paper Material: High quality eco-friendly vinyl, upgraded thickness. Size: 15.8” x 118” and covers 12.8 sq ft. Features: 1. Self adhesive, peel and stick 2. Grid lines on the back, super easy to DIY 3. Waterproof and easy to clean 4. Easy to remove without residue left DIY Instructions: 1. Thoroughly clean the surface you want to decorate, make sure it is smooth, clean and dry. 2. Measure the size( 1 or 2 inches more), then cut according to the grid lines. 3. Peel off the back film from the corner gradually, DO NOT PEEL OFF AT ONCE. With a towel in another hand, smooth out any bubbles as you move along. 4. Trim off the excess. 5. Enjoy your creative work. WARM NOTICE: Buy enough rolls at a time to ensure that they come from the same batch, avoiding color differences. If there are still any bubbles when you are done applying, you can use a needle to get rid of the rest bubbles. If there are some wrinkles on the wallpaper you received, please don’t worry, those wrinkles will disappear naturally along with the peel and stick process. Contact Us: If you are not satisfied with our wallpapers, please be sure to contact us by email. We will do our best to help you solve the problem, and we look forward to giving us more suggestions and support. Packages Included: 1 x Metallic Stainless Steel Wallpaper 1 x Paste Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GE1pW8k0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melwod","source_asin":"B086QFDHP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086QFDHP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086QFDHP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
