window.products.push({"id":712201,"name":"9999 Day Retirement Countdown Clock with Large Display Digital Timer & a 4x6 Picture Frame, Fun Gifts for Men or Women Change Photo & Count Down to Va","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818MRsZgSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE DISPLAY retirement countdown clock with a standard 4x6 picture that can be changed for any event or presentation. Also doubles as a 24hr clock. You can also toggle between the two. The EZ SET UP makes it fun to countdown the days until retirement. No need to compute number of days or hours. Just set the date and time and let it do the work for you. The PICTURES ARE INTERCHANGEABLE . Just pop in your favorite picture and start a new count down or leave it blank. Digital timers are fun retirement gifts for men or a retirement gift for women. It also makes a great gift for firefighter, police, army, navy or any branch of the military. You can change the picture and use it to count days till wedding, vacation, Halloween, birthday, Christmas, xmas, christmad, graduation, easter, golf tee time, tea time, sports events or any other occasion. It's also a great reusable multi use countdown timer for teachers to use in their classroom. Use it to count down to any christian or any other religious holidays. Once the counter reaches 0 an audible alarm will sound. Does not have remote capabilities or downloadable app. If your product does not have DuraForge name on it then that is a sign of a cheap counterfeit and not authentic Duraforge product. Duraforge products are quality made and are packaged in a beautiful box. Buy with pride and confidence. Click Buy Now to complete your purchase. SPECIFICATIONS Function: Digital Timer & 24 Hour Clock Size: 7 ½ x 7 ¼ inches LCD Size: 5/8 x 5 inches Picture Size: 4x6 Standard Picture Counting Capacity: 9999 day Count down, that’s over 27 years Displays: Days, Hours, Minutes, Seconds Batteries: 2 AAA batteries (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818MRsZgSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DuraForge","source_asin":"B07WS2MLH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WS2MLH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WS2MLH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
