window.products.push({"id":712286,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 10-Piece Glitter Plastic Organizer (13.75” x 11.2” x 5.1”) Set w/Cut-Out Handles, Multi-Functional Home Storage, Desk, Office, Bathroom, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tl-N179tS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a stylish and tasteful way to keep your home organized? With this fashionable Isaac Jacobs 10-piece glitter storage bin set you can easily keep rooms and desks neat without sacrificing style. Made for desks, bedrooms, play areas, closets and bathrooms, you’ll find no limit of uses with these bins. This unique storage solution contains a variety of sizes including 2 small round bins, 2 small square bins, 2 medium rectangle bins, 2 large rectangle bins, 1 shallow tray, and 1 medium bin with cut-out handles. All 10 pieces can neatly fit together with the outer medium bin measuring 13.75” L x 11.2 W” x 5.1” H. With so many options you can use them all over your home! Tidy up the learning workspace using the smallest bins to store electronic accessories like chargers and cords, and the rectangle bins to hold pencils, pens and other school and office supplies. The shallow bin is also good for the office and perfectly holds extra paper, folders or loose mail. The medium deep bin is large enough to hold books and magazines. Or use it in playrooms, bedrooms and closets to help keep them clutter free. You can even use these bins in the bathroom to keep toiletries and bath products neatly arranged or use in the closet to organize beauty products and linens. All inner bins are 2.4” tall which makes them superb for tabletop use. Isaac Jacobs is a world leader in stylish home décor. This 10-piece set is excellent for large jobs, but for straightening smaller areas the 5-piece set is also available. No matter what the job, these bins are great space saving storage solutions. Choose from 5 eye-catching colors, gold, iridescent, champagne, and silver, and get organizing today! (All inner bins: 2.4” H) [2 Small Round Pieces: 4” L x 4” W. 2 Small Square Pieces: 4.7” L x 4.7” W. 2 Medium Rectangle Pieces: 7.2” L x 3.7” W. 2 Large Rectangle Pieces: 9.7” L x 4” W. Shallow Piece: 13.75” L x 11.4” W. Medium Outer Bin: 13.75” L x 11.2” W x 5.1” H]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tl-N179tS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B094RHLBFP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094RHLBFP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094RHLBFP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
