window.products.push({"id":712352,"name":"SELF Balance Chair : Self Balancing, Core Muscle Strengthening, Horseback Riding Posture, Any Direction Tilt for Heathy Back, The Wide Base, Height Ad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bKcPs8VzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"♣ SELF BALANCE CHAIR♣ is designed to support your entire body. Does your back start aching after sitting for a while? How do you sit on your chair? On average, people spend more than 8 hours daily, sitting on their chairs. However, it is nearly impossible to maintain a proper posture throughout the day. The “Self-Balance Chair” assists you in securing your best sitting posture. ♣THE CHAIR NATURALLY STEERS YOU♣ to form horseback riding posture which provides an effortless experience Office workers who sit for an extended period. Students who study for a prolonged period. Teachers who work with younger students. Anybody who often needs to stretch their body. Now, simply just take a seat. ♣HORSEBACK RIDING POSTURE♣ The perfect posture for your physical balance, Horseback riding is known for maintaining good posture. However, riding a horse in real life is not easy. The movement of the saddle chair makes a movement similar to a horseback riding posture, straightening the back and stretching the muscles to help relax the muscles and have a correct posture. ♣Core Muscle Strengthening ♣ Sitting all the time in one position while in the office or working at home puts stress on your lower back, hips and thighs. The SELF BALANCE CHAIR is designed to operate according to the movement of the human body naturally in all directions 360 degrees, so it can move flexibly according to the movement of the human body during office or working at home. relax a waist. Since it is used together with your current chair or Saddle only, you can sit and relax in the SELF BALANCE CHAIR every 30 minutes or 1 hour while working. ♣ANY DIRECTION 8-DEGREE TILT♣ for Heathy Back on The Wide Base. The 8-degree tilt function made with our patented technology makes you maintain your riding posture and self-balance. Its unique and ergonomic design allows it to adapt to the movement of the seated person, giving it the unique function of a SELF BALANCE CHAIR. ♣FUNCTION♣ Any Direction Tilt, Height Adjust, Swivel The height can be adjusted according to the height of the person sitting, which is a common function of the chair, and the chair swivel too. In addition, it makes it possible to tilt 8 degrees in all directions 360 degrees. ♣HIGH-DENSE SEAT FOAM♣ with unprecedented comfort By using high-density injection foam in the shape of a horse saddle, it helps to maintain the riding posture while maintaining strength and durability. ♣EASY ASSEMBLE & MANUAL♣ First, place the chair base on a flat floor and insert the gas spring on it. And please insert chair seat well on it. Now, sit carefully and check chair seat and gas lift, base firmly inserted well, and enjoy SELF BALANCE CHAIR! Please also read the enclosed manual for assemble and read the cautions in the manual carefully for safe use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bKcPs8VzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHAIR MEISTER","source_asin":"B09RFDWRD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RFDWRD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RFDWRD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
