window.products.push({"id":712376,"name":"ZZBIQS Extra Large Wardrobe Clothes Storage Closet, Portable Garment Organizer Shelves Rack, Flannel Fabric Cover Standing Closet with Hang Rod and 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719mSFNTR3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✔ZZBIQS closet storage comes with 3 movable clothes hanging rod, divided into 7 different size storage shelves and 2 side pockets.  ✔It can offers you extra space both for your longer outfits, toys, books, and folded clothes. ✔You can put suitcases or other things on top, your shoes can also be placed underneath of the wardrobe ✔Zipper dustproof cover can be rolled up and fixed with a duty tape and fabric tiers are easy to clean. ✔The bottom of our wardrobe is designed to be higher than others, so you don't have to worry about wet floors making your clothes wet. Notice: Please follow the instructions on the picture to install During installation, connect the steel pipe and PP link pipe tightly to make sure that the connection port is in place, otherwise the cloth cover will be too small. The cutting surface of the pipe is very sharp, be careful during installation.The PP plastic connecting pipes work well after soaking in hot water. Installation steps: All tubes are divided into four models: A, B, C, and D. The PP link tube is divided into 3 holes, 4 holes and 5 holes.The unmarked tubes in the picture are interlayer thin tubes.Please sort before installation. Step1: Install the bottom round pipe, and the thin interlayer pipe should be inserted into the round hole on the pipe of different models. Step 2: Spread out the cloth cover after inserting 8 C pipes, align the eight holes at the bottom of the cloth cover with the C pipe, and cover it from top to bottom. Step 3:Please refer to the picture to continue to install the bracket. Step 4: After the whole bracket is installed, slowly pull up the cloth cover to make it cover the whole bracket, and then straighten the cloth surface. Step 5: Refer to the picture for the correct installation method of curtain rope and clothes hook. Step 6:Enjoy the sense of accomplishment brought by DIY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719mSFNTR3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZZBIQS","source_asin":"B08LPV2J8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LPV2J8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LPV2J8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
