window.products.push({"id":712404,"name":"Portable Mini Humidifier, 350ml Small Nano Cool Mist Humidifier,USB Desktop Humidifier 2 Mist Modes, 24h Mute ,With sleeping atmosphere light,for Baby","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mKkpm29LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color:white snowy mountain night light, pink snowy mountain night 📣Is your skin peeling because of air dryness? 🔸Our Plant mini Humidifier can give fresh moisturizing environment for indoor plants.Now, buy a mini desktop humidifier! 🔸we will have a fresh and moist living space. 🌼Specification: Color: White / Pink 2 colors can be selected Water capacity: 350ml Product weight: 150g Product size: 2.96*2.96*5.2in Input voltage: DC 5.0V Power Rating: 2 - 4W Material: ABS/PP/PC 🌼Package Includes Plant Humidifier Indoor*1pc USB*1pc Qualified Certificate nstruction manual*1pc 🌼HOW TO USE: 1：Night lamp function： -Long press the power button 1st time, Turn on the night light ，the LED light will be on(warm light). -Long press the power button 2nd time, Turn off night light. -The night light can be turned on separately or when it is sprayed 2：Spray mode: -Short press the mist button 1st time, Continuous spray -Short press the mist button 2nd time, Intermittent spray （Spray for 5 seconds and stop for 3 seconds） -Short press the mist button 3rd time, Turn off spray. 💖Cotton filter replacement -Pull out the cotton filter for replacement. -Aften replacing the cotton filter, please soak the cotton filter completely and then put it into the humidifier. -Please pay attention to the bottom spring when replacing. 🌼Warmly Note: -Please add water before using this product. Humidifying function is prohibited in case of water shortage. -This product gives priority to tap water/mineral water, because pure water/distilled water will condense water droplets at the spray port, which may block the spray port. -Children under age of 8 should be accompanied by adults to use the machine. 💖If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mKkpm29LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEKEE","source_asin":"B09B28LG3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B28LG3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B28LG3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
