window.products.push({"id":712467,"name":"G's Best Vintage Michelin Star Wooden Recipe Box | 100 4\"x6\" Recipe Cards | 4\"x6\" 9 Dividers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V7XhC9mEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"G's Best's refined recipe box is the perfect product for cooking enthusiasts! I still remember when I was a kid, somewhere in 1967, my aunt standing in the kitchen over steaming pots as she put on her glasses in a funny way while pulling out a card from the recipe box engraved with an old recipe. ‏My dear aunt inherited our family's real treasure, she inherited our great grandmother's Recipe Box, and as if by magic, over the years her kitchen became a source of inspiration to us all. ‏My aunt's kitchen is the real centre of the house, and today, after my aunt left me our family's Recipe Box, my kitchen is the centre of the house. ‏At family events hours before sitting at the holiday table, my children and grandchildren come in and out of the kitchen and look to flicker a small piece of our great-great-grandma’s cheese cake. ‏I feel that the Recipe Box is one of the most impressive legacies of our family. A day will come and I too will pass it on to my children. G's Best's amazing Recipe Box is a necessary addition to any kitchen that strives to create a continuity of tradition and a solid family connection. Our Recipe Box includes 100 recipe cards and 9 matching dividers, six of which are labeled by categories and three for free labeling. The design of the cards and dividers is inspired by the cooking traditions of hundreds of years. Our Recipe Box is made of eco-friendly materials: wood, metal, and strong and thick recycled paper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V7XhC9mEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G's Best","source_asin":"B08HHX4BF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HHX4BF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HHX4BF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
