window.products.push({"id":712554,"name":"Professional Box Grater,Nonstick Coating Stainless Steel with 6 Sides - Vegetable Chopper, Kitchen Cutter, Shredder for Cheese & Vegetables (6-in-1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YW3oK-MLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIFUNCTIONAL KITCHEN ESSENTIAL – Grate vegetables like a pro, soft/hard cheese effortlessly with wider surface & coarser side, extract maximum flavour of citrus rind with a dedicated zester side, grate breadcrumbs or ginger using finer mesh, or slice cucumbers & other veggies in a breeze using the slicer plane – HCUANG 6 sided Box Grater is a versatile tool that proves handy & indispensable. Size: 9.5\"*3.3\"2.3\" . Weight: 310g. SAFE & FUNCTIONALLY EFFECTIVE – With a curved arch-shaped design (convex), our cheese grater slicer or zester grater reduces risk of grating your knuckles/skin, which otherwise is a common problem, and thus offers improved safety. The arched design also makes the process of grating more intuitive and easier. Moreover, the engineered design, with sharp & perfectly sized holes corresponding to each function, makes this food grater best-in-class. ERGONOMIC DESIGN – With a generously sized ergonomic handle that offers a comfortable grip without putting any undue strain on your hand, a non-slip bottom that prevents the cheese grater box from slipping (whether kept on platform or cutting board), and a generous cavity that can hold sufficient quantity without requiring you to empty it frequently, our hand grater stands a class apart, and is ideal for both professional and home kitchens. STURDIER & PREMIUM BUILD – Made from high-quality food grade stainless steel, our box grater zester comes with a reinforced top and bottom, such that it doesn't bend, break or warp like inferior quality graters, and feels solid in use. Moreover, it looks great in any modern kitchen, and is way easier to clean as it is DISHWASHER-SAFE too! Product has nonstick coating on the surface, which is easier to clean than stainless steel and less rusty. 100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – We also offer you 100% risk-free satisfaction guarantee on this 6-In-1 kitchen grater to let you buy with confidence; no questions asked. However, we are quite sure that you will be super impressed with its reliable & durable build, thoughtful arched design, and the fact that it can be used as a coarse grater, fine grater, parmesan grater, ginger grater, slicer and even as a zester.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YW3oK-MLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HCHUANG","source_asin":"B09SDFPX45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SDFPX45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SDFPX45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
