window.products.push({"id":712808,"name":"Tea Kettle - 2.5QT Whistling Tea Pots for Stove Top - Food Grade Stainless Steel Teapot - Classic Stovetop Kettle with Universal Base, Cool Grip Bakel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ej5oMopPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SAFE MATERIALS AND CLASSICAL DESIGN】- M-MAX has been pursuing the balance of design form and function, our teapots (except handle and lid knob) are made of premuim stainless steel, free of toxic substances such as PTFE and BPA, to protect you healthy. Clean lines and a high-end mirror polished finish allow the teakettle to complement any kitchen layout and design. 【POWER SAVING | QUICK HEATING】 - RECOMMENDED BOILING VOLUME: 1-1.5QT. The whistling tea kettle is professionally designed with SINGLE-LAYER induction metal, and the body follows the shape of the heat cycle design, which is heated evenly and reduces the waiting time. The built-in snap of the lid fits tightly with the body to prevent heat loss during the boiling process. It is compatible with all types of cooktops, including induction, gas, electric, halogen and radiant cooktops. 【LOUD AND NOT HARSH WHISTLE】- We have specially upgraded the whistle mechanism to ensure the tea kettle for stove top works properly when the water is boiling to attract your attention and reduce safety hazards. With this charming tea pot, you will make delicious hot cocoa/tea/coffee with the family. (🌟🌟NOTE: Please make sure to close the dust cover of the spout and the lid of the teapot tightly when working.) 【DESIGNED FOR SAFETY AND COMFORT】-The body of this teapot is sealed with a one-piece design, which is sealed and watertight, and the interior has a clear mark of the maximum water level to prevent you from overfilling. The lightweight tea pots for stove top have a built-in anti-scald bakelite handle to ensure a secure and comfortable grip, maximizing your lifting, pouring and filling comfort, which is very friendly to the elderly and those with hand arthritis. 【SUPERIOR QUALITY WITH M-MAX】- The kitchen should be fun. With M-MAX, that's it. In addition to our one-year warranty, we also offer quick & convenient kitchen solutions to simplify your hectic life, including small kitchen appliances, cookware & housewares.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ej5oMopPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M-MAX","source_asin":"B0BX24KY6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX24KY6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX24KY6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
