window.products.push({"id":712911,"name":"Potahouse Storage Bins with Lids 8.4 Gal Plastic Folding Storage Box for Closet Organizer 1 Pack Clear Stackable Storage Bins with Door Collapsible To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TEyuVY-lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Foldable & Two-Step Installation】The Potahouse Storage box is foldable and installation-free. Plastic storage boxes can be folded when you don't need them. You don't need to save the instructions to remember how to assemble it, just snap the parts together when you use it and it folds up when you don't need to use it.The folding function can help you save a lot of space, is a family storage essential plastic storage box with lid. 【Two Opening Ways & Transparent Design】Storage bins with lids are able to open in two ways. You can open the lid at the top of the folded storage box, or you can open it through the front door.Front doors have built-in latches that control locking and unlocking of the doors by turning the brown handle. Please note that the front door is not removable.Transparent design makes it easier for people to reach things. 【Robust, Stackable & Moveable】Stackable storage bins are made of durable, heavy-duty PP material for rugged durability. Sturdy enough to withstand 88 lbs (40 kg) of weight. Four easy to maneuver wheels are built into the bottom, allowing it to move around when doing cleaning.The grooves on the folding storage bins are designed so they can be stacked without tipping over. You can feel completely comfortable stacking several storage boxes together. 【Large Capacity & Multi-purpose】 Size of each storage box: 19.3 \"L*12.2 \"W, 11.8 \"H (3.6\" when folded). Maximum loading capacity 8.4 gallons. The handles on both sides are designed to lift the clothing organizer well. The storage box with lid can also be used as an ideal closet clothing organizer, bedroom storage, kitchen storage box, bathroom storage, toy storage, snack storage, quilt storage or office storage and school storage. 【100% Satisfaction Guarantee】 We strive to offer products that satisfy our customers, so we have very strict requirements on the production process. When you receive the product due to damage during transportation or any problem during use, please contact us in time, we will give you a satisfactory solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TEyuVY-lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Potahouse","source_asin":"B0C6KG25K1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-712911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6KG25K1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6KG25K1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
